		(descr "Generic 0.96in 128x64 SSD1306 I2C OLED module (4-pin GND VCC SCL SDA) mounted on a 1x04 2.54mm female socket. Origin = module centre, header row 12.0mm above it. No standoff holes: the 4.0mm keep-outs at (+-10.7, +-11.5) keep room to add 2.6mm M2 holes back (both common hole patterns, +-10.25 and +-11.15 by +-11.5). Outline 27.3 x 27.8mm.")
