		(property "Description" "2.2k I2C pull-up, 1%. I=(Vrail-VOL)/R; at 3.3V and VOL=0.4V, 1.32mA. For a 300ns limit, RC 30-70% rise permits <=161pF nominal (159pF at +1% R). Verify receiver VOL, real capacitance, any parallel pull-ups and configured bus timing; not a universal 400kHz approval."
